| Gradient start | `gradientStart` | `#0d2844` |
| Gradient end | `gradientEnd` | `#0a1628` |
| Glass card | `cardBackground` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.06)` |
| Glass elevated | `cardBackgroundElevated` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.09)` |
| Primary action | `tealAccent` | `#2ec4b6` |
| Teal glow | `tealGlow` | `rgba(46,196,182,0.45)` |
| Text primary | `textPrimary` | `#FFFFFF` |
