## Typography

| Role | Font |
|---|---|
| Headings | DM Sans Bold |
| Body / UI | DM Sans |
| Numbers | JetBrains Mono |

## Visual Character

- **Dark gradient background** with subtle grid overlay and left-side teal glow orb
- **Glassmorphism cards** — semi-transparent, blur on native, inset highlight border
- **Teal is the only action color** — buttons, progress bars, highlights use `#2ec4b6`
- **Soft glow shadows** on primary CTAs and hero result cards
- **Depth through blur + glow**, not flat borders
- **Destructive actions** use red `#ff6b6b`, never teal

## Component Standards

- Cards: `borderRadius: 20`, glass bg, `BlurView` on native, `1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` border
- Header: transparent over gradient, badge pill with status dot, title with teal highlight span
- Buttons: solid teal primary with dark text; ghost with transparent bg + border; destructive red outline
- Inputs: recessed dark glass fields, teal selection color, mono for values
- Progress bars: teal fill on dark recessed track
- Charts: bright accent colors tuned for dark backgrounds

## Animation

- Spring bounce: `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)`
- Slide: `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`
- Use `react-native-reanimated` for card entry and value transitions

## Code Standards

- No calculation logic in components — use hooks and pure utils
- Precompute chart/table data in hooks
- Use TypeScript strict mode throughout
